
{
  "content": "<p>« <a href=\"../../../pages/child-development/index.html\">Previous</a></p>\n\n    <h3 id=\"removed-clip-1-a-video-demonstrating-how-young-children-understand-object-permanence\">Removed Clip 1: A video demonstrating how young children understand object permanence</h3>\n\n<p>See <a   class=\"external-link \"   target=\"_blank\"   href=\"http://www.youtube.com/results?search_query=object&#43;permanence&amp;oq=object&#43;permanence&amp;aq=f&amp;aqi=g4&amp;aql=&amp;gs_sm=3&amp;gs_upl=406970l411316l0l411393l19l18l1l9l10l0l248l1230l2.5.1l8l0\"  aria-label=\"YouTube (opens in a new tab)\"  >YouTube</a> for similar videos.</p>\n\n    <h3 id=\"removed-clip-2-a-video-about-renee-baillargeons-childrens-show-magical-events\">Removed Clip 2: A video about Renee Baillargeon&rsquo;s children&rsquo;s show Magical Events</h3>\n\n<p>The video shown in class is not available online, however Vanderbilt University has provided a (much longer) video of Renee Baillargeon discussing what was learned from her children&rsquo;s show &ldquo;Magical Events.&rdquo;</p>\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n<div class=\"video-embed video-player-wrapper\">\n  \n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n  <div class=\"show-offline alert alert-warning\" role=\"alert\">\n    \n    \n      <svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" height=\"24\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" width=\"24\">\n  <path d=\"M0 0h24v24H0z\" fill=\"none\"/>\n  <path d=\"M15.5 14h-.79l-.28-.27C15.41 12.59 16 11.11 16 9.5 16 5.91 13.09 3 9.5 3S3 5.91 3 9.5 5.91 16 9.5 16c1.61 0 3.09-.59 4.23-1.57l.27.28v.79l5 4.99L20.49 19l-4.99-5zm-6 0C7.01 14 5 11.99 5 9.5S7.01 5 9.5 5 14 7.01 14 9.5 11.99 14 9.5 14z\" fill=\"#ffffff\"/>\n</svg>\n\n    \n    Viewing videos requires an internet connection\n  </div>\n\n<div class=\"video-container embedded-video-container youtube-container\">\n  <video\n    id=\"video-player-Zd7OIDm_btM-a9e34cc954ff1c8099d531c02a4f69fa\"\n    class=\"video-js vjs-default-skin vjs-big-play-centered vjs-ocw\"\n    controls\n    data-downloadlink = \"\"\n    data-transcriptlink = \"\"\n    \n  >\n      \n  </video>\n</div>\n\n\n\n<script>\n  window.handleVideoJSError = function(err) {\n    console.error('Error loading VideoJS or YouTube player:', err)\n    var youtubeVideoContainers = document.querySelectorAll('.video-container.youtube-container')\n    for (var i = 0; i < youtubeVideoContainers.length; i++) {\n      youtubeVideoContainers[i].style.display = 'none';\n    }\n\n    var fallbackContainers = document.querySelectorAll('.video-fallback-container')\n    for (var j = 0; j < fallbackContainers.length; j++) {\n      fallbackContainers[j].style.display = 'block';\n    }\n  }\n\n  try {\n      new Function(\"class X{#abc;}; 1??2; ({})?.abc\");\n  }\n  catch (e) {\n    window.handleVideoJSError(e)\n  }\n\n  window.addEventListener('load', function() {\n    if (window.initVideoJS) {\n      window.initVideoJS()\n    }\n  })\n</script>\n\n\n\n  \n  \n  \n\n\n\n\n\n<div class=\"video-tab-toggle-section pointer\">\n  <div class=\"video-tab-header d-flex\">\n    \n      <span class=\"tab-title-section\">\n        \n          <a href=\"../../../resources/how-infants-learn-dr-renee-baillargeon/index.html\" aria-label=\"View video page\">\n          <i class=\"material-icons toggle md-18\" aria-hidden=\"true\"></i>\n<span class=\"tab-title\">View video page</span>\n\n          </a>\n        \n      </span>\n    \n    \n    \n  </div>\n  \n</div>\n\n<div class=\"video-tab container collapse pr-0 \" role=\"tabpanel\">\n  <div class=\"video-tab-content-section\">\n    \n  </div>\n</div>\n\n  \n</div>\n\n<p>This video is from <a   class=\"external-link \"   target=\"_blank\"   href=\"http://www.youtube.com/user/VanderbiltUniversity?feature=watch\"  aria-label=\"Vanderbilt University (opens in a new tab)\"  >Vanderbilt University</a> on YouTube and is not provided under our <a href=\"/terms/#cc/index.html\">Creative Commons license</a>.</p>\n\n    <h3 id=\"removed-clip-3-a-video-about-how-young-children-understand-conservation\">Removed Clip 3: A video about how young children understand conservation</h3>\n\n<p>See <a   class=\"external-link \"   target=\"_blank\"   href=\"http://www.youtube.com/results?search_query=piaget&#43;conservation&amp;oq=piaget&#43;conservation&amp;aq=f&amp;aqi=g9&amp;aql=&amp;gs_sm=3&amp;gs_upl=3794l6322l0l6649l19l17l0l8l8l0l201l1320l2.6.1l9l0\"  aria-label=\"YouTube (opens in a new tab)\"  >YouTube</a> for similar videos.</p>\n\n    <h3 id=\"removed-clip-4-a-change-of-mind\">Removed Clip 4: &ldquo;A Change of Mind&rdquo;</h3>\n\n<p>&ldquo;A Change of Mind&rdquo; (length 12 minutes). Program 26 from <em>Scientific American Frontiers Introductory Psychology Video Collection</em>. Worth Publishers, 2002.</p>\n<p>« <a href=\"../../../pages/child-development/index.html\">Previous</a></p>\n",
